RULE TunnelPumpOff
IF Node ScreenShaft Depth <= 20
AND LINK WWTP_DIS-WWTP_OUT FLOW > 0
THEN PUMP Pump@WWTP_HRT setting = 0
RULE TunnelPumpOn
IF Node ScreenShaft Depth >= 35
AND LINK WWTP_DIS-WWTP_OUT FLOW > 0
THEN PUMP Pump@WWTP_HRT setting = CURVE ExtraWWTP
RULE TunnelPumpOnOff
IF Node ScreenShaft Depth > 20
AND PUMP Pump@WWTP_HRT status = ON
AND LINK WWTP_DIS-WWTP_OUT FLOW > 0
THEN PUMP Pump@WWTP_HRT setting = CURVE ExtraWWTP




